  upstreamcodec  generateheader output   id  req parseandcheckexpectations           
    parse    
    expect eq callbacks  messagebegin  1   
    expect eq callbacks  headerscomplete  1   
    expect eq callbacks  messagecomplete  1   
    expect eq callbacks  streamerrors  0   
    expect eq callbacks  sessionerrors  0   
    assert callbacks  msg   
     
 
  parseandcheckexpectations parsedheaders   callbacks  msg- extractheaders    
