      output   1  std  move buf   httpcodec  nopadding httpheaders trailers  
  trailers add  x-trailer-1    pico-de-gallo    
  trailers add  x-trailer-2    chicken-kyiv    
  downstreamcodec  generatetrailers output   1  trailers   
 
  parseupstream    
 
  callbacks  expectmessage 2  200   
  expect eq callbacks  bodycalls  1   
  expect eq callbacks  bodylength  5 headers   callbacks  msg- getheaders    
  expect callbacks  msg- getheaders   exists http header date    
